      "<p><b>Olinishi:</b> karbid usuli: CaC₂ + 2H₂O → C₂H₂ + Ca(OH)₂; metandan: 2CH₄ → C₂H₂ + 3H₂ (1500 °C); digalogenalkanlardan KOH(spirt) bilan.</p><p><b>Kimyoviy xossalari:</b></p><ul><li>birikish (ikki bosqichda): C₂H₂ + 2H₂ → C₂H₆; + 2Br₂ → C₂H₂Br₄ (bromli suv rangsizlanadi);</li><li>HCl birikishi: C₂H₂ + HCl → CH₂=CHCl (vinilxlorid — PVX monomeri);</li><li><b>Kucherov</b> (gidratatsiya, Hg²⁺): C₂H₂ + H₂O → CH₃CHO (sirka aldegid);</li><li>trimerlanish: 3C₂H₂ → C₆H₆ (benzol, ko‘mir, 600 °C);</li><li>kislotali xossa: C₂H₂ + 2[Ag(NH₃)₂]OH → Ag₂C₂↓ (kumush asetilenid) — <b>terminal alkinlarga sifat reaksiya</b>;</li><li>yonish: 2C₂H₂ + 5O₂ → 4CO₂ + 2H₂O (dudli alanga, kislorodda — 3000 °C).</li></ul><p><b>Ishlatilishi:</b> payvandlash va kesish, PVX, sirka kislota, sintetik kauchuk, erituvchilar.</p>",
